  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Not for Profit Partnership - Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Not for Profit Partnership - Mozambique is a component of Access &amp; Beneficiary Feedback Pilots Programme: Pilot programme to test mechanisms of seeking feedback by people directly affected by aid projects reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;181,063. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Education policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
